														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2728101">
									

<p>I am inclined to give a neutral. While you have resolved a significant number of issues from my initial read of it, it is somewhat mind-numbing to grasp why they would need a naval admiral for the top job in a covert organisation; the two jobs are quite different (and I am sure that the Foundation would care about experience than qualifications).</p>

