<p>There are only a handful of things required to pull this off:</p>
<ul>
<li>Intel on the American operation - either SIGINT or via a mole.</li>
<li>Ability to interfere with Japanese logistics, either through subterfuge or bribery</li>
<li>Ability to produce or find an anomalously durable plane, as well as the knife.</li>
<li>Competent intelligence bureau.</li>
</ul>
<p>In addition to the Foundation, I think this falls well within the capabilities of Prometheus Labs, MC&amp;D, Chaos Insurgency, and probably the proto-GOC forces. Probably others as well, but those for sure.</p>
<p>My interpretation is that this is a legitimate Foundation operation - but it is not unreasonable to hang on to the possibility of a non-Foundation operation.</p>

